# init.recovery.mt6761.rc — fixes applied during BF7 investigation:
#   - missing `import /init.mt6761.usb.rc` broke ADB/USB in recovery; added.
#   - duplicate `service mobicore` definitions between this file and
#     vendor/etc/init/trustonic.rc caused a conflict — only ONE definition
#     should exist across the merged ramdisk. If you regenerate this file
#     from a fresh twrpdtgen pull, grep the final ramdisk for
#     "service mobicore" and make sure it appears exactly once before
#     repacking.

import /init.mt6761.usb.rc
